: [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 4505, "text": "Help your child to make a pattern using the 3 shapes and colours, following the pattern ABC - for example, blue, yellow, red, blue, yellow, red. <br> </br>Ask your child to continue it as far as possible. <br></br>\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 3322, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": null, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 4505, "text": "Help your child to make a pattern using the 3 shapes and colours, following the pattern ABC - for example, blue, yellow, red, blue, yellow, red. <br> </br>Ask your child to continue it as far as possible. <br></br>\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 3322, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": null, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 119730294, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 5, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 3322, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>Main activity:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Ask your child: What is the  <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\"><strong>unit of repeat</strong> in the pattern we just made? <em>Remember: the unit of repeat is the smallest part that repeats over and over.</em></span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">That was an <strong>ABC </strong>pattern. It had <ins>three</ins> different things in it.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Can you make a different pattern that has a <strong>unit of repeat</strong> with <ins>three</ins> different things in it?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Can you make a pattern that has a <strong>unit of repeat </strong>with <ins>four</ins> different things in it?</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">You might need to use a different colour with one of your shapes!</span>&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId